daughters have the relationship

00:39:38.810 --> 00:39:40.150
that you guys have one day,

00:39:40.150 --> 00:39:42.250
but since you love being together,

00:39:42.250 --> 00:39:44.510
I'm hoping that you don't
mind if I take you both

00:39:44.510 --> 00:39:46.979
