00:39:46.979 --> 00:39:48.060
- What!
- What!

00:39:48.060 --> 00:39:51.412
- Yes!
(audience cheers)

00:39:51.412 --> 00:39:53.128
(Drew applauds)

00:39:53.128 --> 00:39:55.387
- Yes, we would love to go.

00:39:55.387 --> 00:39:57.440
