00:39:57.440 --> 00:39:59.228
It's Jennifer Aniston.

00:39:59.228 --> 00:40:00.630
- What!
- What!

00:40:00.630 --> 00:40:03.470
- I know, I freak out over her so hard.

00:40:03.470 --> 00:40:04.690
I love her so much.

00:40:04.690 --> 00:40:05.940
- Yes, we love "Friends."

00:40:06.786 --> 00:40:08.130
- We love Jennifer Aniston.

00:40:08.130 --> 00:40:10.200
- I love "Friends", I
love all of her movies.

00:40:10.200 --> 00:40:11.180
I just love her.

00:40:11.180 --> 00:40:13.670
I'm so excited because she's someone like

00:40:13.670 --> 00:40:17.340
I'm never not gonna
wanna hang on every word.

00:40:17.340 --> 00:40:21.490
So I have these suitcases for you

00:40:21.490 --> 00:40:24.940
