00:40:26.530 --> 00:40:27.400
- We love yellow.

00:40:27.400 --> 00:40:31.060
- You can throw all your stuff
in it and we're flying you

00:40:31.060 --> 00:40:33.120
to LA and you're gonna
be there in the audience

00:40:33.120 --> 00:40:35.153
