00:40:35.153 --> 00:40:36.250
- Oh my goodness.

00:40:36.250 --> 00:40:38.362
- Oh my goodness, thank you so much.

00:40:38.362 --> 00:40:39.862
- This is amazing!

00:40:41.210 --> 00:40:42.770
- Thank you so much.

00:40:42.770 --> 00:40:46.150
