00:40:49.860 --> 00:40:51.820
We think that you guys are amazing.

00:40:51.820 --> 00:40:53.813
And this is gonna be so much fun.

00:40:53.813 --> 00:40:54.930
- [Alicia] Yay!
- [Tiffany] Yay!

00:40:54.930 --> 00:40:56.899
- All right, LA, here we go!

00:40:56.899 --> 00:40:59.117
(sisters cheer)
(audience applauds)

00:40:59.117 --> 00:41:02.450
And then you can keep teaching
