00:41:10.890 --> 00:41:12.320
I mean, I could learn so much from you,

00:41:12.320 --> 00:41:13.840
so that means so much to me.

00:41:13.840 --> 00:41:16.410
So yes, I'd be more than happy to.

00:41:16.410 --> 00:41:19.129
